# ─── Rust / Cargo ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Matches workspace root target/ as well as any per-crate target/
# (e.g. `crates/project/target/` since that crate is its own
# workspace via an empty [workspace] marker).
target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock is kept tracked:
#   - workspace root: required for the workspace binaries
#   - crates/project/Cargo.lock: required for reproducible pvm-contract builds

# ─── pvm-contract / PolkaVM artifacts ─────────────────────────
*.contract
*.polkavm

# ─── Node / Hardhat (crates/project/ and any future ones) ────────
**/node_modules/
**/artifacts/
**/cache/
**/typechain-types/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/coverage.json
**/target/

# Hardhat Ignition: ignore local/ephemeral deployment journals,
# keep testnet/mainnet manifests versioned explicitly.
**/ignition/deployments/chain-31337/
**/ignition/deployments/chain-1337/

# ─── DotForge deployment state ────────────────────────────────
crates/deployments.json

# ─── Secrets / env ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── DotForge CLI local state ─────────────────────────────────
.dotforge/

# ─── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ─── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
